{"title":"G285 2021 Summer Problem Set Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=G285_2021_Summer_Problem_Set_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/e/afea61bbc7bbc2d72748d6750aa5252ac6dd978a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x,y) = \\begin{cases}x^y &amp; \\text{ if } x^2&gt;y \\text{ and } |x|&lt;y\\\\f(f(\\sqrt{|x|},y),y) &amp; \\text{ otherwise} \\end{cases}\\]\" width=\"395\" height=\"53\" /> If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is a positive integer, find the sum of all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/3/3e3dbf51a7e70803e9b69704477aaa79216d3532.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x,y) \\neq k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"87\" height=\"18\" /> for some constant <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/8/e68ffba142207af7baf730920006dc8a428a9692.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -1 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ -\\frac{1}{2} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 0 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{3}{8} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"400\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=G285_2021_Summer_Problem_Set_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/8/4284392395e3f7155d778c25fc24073af2c4dc36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\in \\{ -1,1 \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" />, our function approaches an infinite recursion. Now, for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/7/3c7520f1d4a703308c2b7c8a05e2a52b307d07ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1&lt;x&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"90\" height=\"12\" />, we have the function approaches <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, which also is an infinite recursion. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/3/6d3e5c8b720eb869d82a43ffb5d64e5bc3e46486.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018085229\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.008 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 50/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2180/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:21533:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018085229 and revision id 157027. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}